OL,3,GCentral, Tayside & Fife
OL,4,
OL,5,CMonday:FA mainly dry and bright
OL,6,Fmorning with just isolated showers.
OL,7,FThe showers developing more widely for
OL,8,Fa time in the afternoon, heavy in
OL,9,Fplaces, then dying out. Feeling warm.
OL,10,
OL,11,COutlook for Tuesday to Thursday:FA
OL,12,Funsettled period with sunny spells and
OL,13,Ffurther showers, heavy at times. A
OL,14,Fspell of wet and windy weather on
OL,15,FWednesday.
OL,23,QppppppppppppppppppppGSource: Met Office
